<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia British Assurance 6-mth net up.</title>
<headline>Malaysia British Assurance 6-mth net up.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to July 31,1996</p>
<p>		     (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		6.88	  vs	  4.41</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)    17.0	   vs	 11.0</p>
<p>    Dividend  (percent)   nil	   vs	  3.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		132.07	  vs	111.32</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 13.62	  vs	 12.45</p>
<p>    Minorities     less   0.15	  vs  less  0.22</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	 9.39	  vs	  nil</p>
<p>NOTE: The company's full name is Malaysia British Assurance Bhd.</p>
</text>
